WEBVTT

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:04.250
Every line tells a story,
even those we choose to forget.

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:07.700
But some drafts never truly fade.
They just wait.

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:13.150
Quickly, step into the light!
I will save you from the flood.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:20.950
Listen closely to the gears of time.
We are moving together through the shadows.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.600
The stream of time never stops.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:30.350
I am the Warden.
I stand firm against the fading wind.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.600
We are defining a new architectural boundary,

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:39.350
one where silence speaks
and structures breathe.

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:44.050
By my blade, let color be restored!
